cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SPTopo in your research, please cite the archived release."
title: "SPTopo"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
abstract: >-
  SPTopo is a browser-based tool for producing topographic maps of biological
  occurrence records. It supports map layers for land and water, configurable
  symbols and legends, image exports, and editable R map packages.
authors:
